    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»quickPick« Storage Module",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »quickPick« warehouse module is a simple warehouse interface for manipulating individual components, complete tools, fixtures, orders, and accessories. You can process stock bookings with just a few clicks. </p> <p>The integrated 3D layout realistically replicates your warehouse within the software, giving you a quick overview of the storage locations for the items you’re looking for. With the circulation display, you can monitor the usage of your tools.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_software_quickPick_en_dc4f68a89e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3704",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "article statistics",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER’s article statistics allow you to easily analyze your tool consumption based on store bookings or goods receipts. Using “Hit/Flop Lists,” you can identify your “top items,” which offer significant potential for optimization, while avoiding “flop items” that lie in your stores as dead capital.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_software_artikelstatistik_en_2144c04cfa.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3702",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "inspection tool management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Modern companies that are certified to ISO 9001 and other quality standards have the obligation to maintain a management system for the calibration of their inspection tools and calibrators. Here, ZOLLER offers a convenient inspection tool management system that allows any inspection tools and calibrators to be managed and monitored. Users can integrate test plans and link documents. In addition to monitoring calibration intervals—dependent on time or usage—custom test plans can be created and assigned to any inspection tool.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/e/csm_software_pruefmittel_en_18b0641458.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3700",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Device Management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Do you want to organize your fixture management with precise timing and keep track of your status? Would you like to enter and manage all data quickly, conveniently, and transparently? Then ZOLLER fixture management has you covered. The monitoring interval, which can be defined for each fixture, also helps you keep your fixtures up to date.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/6/csm_software_vorrichtung_en_5dda553b0f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3698",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
