  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart Solutions for Your Connected Manufacturing </h2>",
   "body": "<p>All storage locations are clearly and transparently represented in the TMS Tool Management Solutions software. This makes the controlled removal and logging of tools simple compared to previous versions.</p>",
